Package: libfdk1
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: FemBoyGamerTechGuy <242450780+FemBoyGamerTechGuy@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Version: @PKGVER@
Depends: @RUNTIME_DEPS@
Recommends: libgl1
Homepage: https://github.com/Faded-Dream-Project/FDK
Description: Faded Dream ToolKit — native GUI toolkit runtime (X11 and Wayland)
 FDK is a general-purpose native C GUI toolkit for modern Linux
 desktops: native X11 and Wayland backends talking directly to Xlib
 and libwayland-client, a damage-tracked software rasterizer with an
 optional GPU present lane, its own widget, layout, text, and theme
 engines, and FDK-drawn window decorations.
 .
 This package carries the FDK runtime: the shared library and the
 default theme (faded-dream). Applications built with FDK are governed
 by their authors' own licenses (see the FDK Proprietary License,
 Section 5); the runtime itself is installed separately by the end
 user per its Section 4(d).
